WEBVTT

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.800
(RADIO STATIC)

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.800
This is Agent Leland Turbo.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.920
I have a flash transmission
for Agent Finn McMissile.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.920
Finn, my cover's been compromised.
Everything's gone pear-shaped.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.960
You won't believe what I found out here.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:03.360
This is bigger than anything we've ever
seen, and no one even knows it exists.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:07.480
Finn, I need backup, but don't call
the cavalry, it could blow the operation.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.000
-And be careful. It's not safe out here.
-CAR: Let's go.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.560
Transmitting my grids now. Good luck.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.960
(BEEPING)

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:47.680
All right, buddy, we're here.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.360
Right where you paid me to bring you.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.480
Question is, why?

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:55.040
I'm looking for a car.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:56.800
A car? Ha!

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:00.280
Hey, pal, you can't get any further away
from land than out here.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.040
Exactly where I want to be.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:06.040
I got news for you, buddy.
There's nobody out here but us.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.800
(SHIP'S HORN)

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.640
SHIP: What are you doing out here?

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:12.280
What does it look like, genius?
I'm crabbing.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:16.320
Well, turn around
and go back where you came from.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.400
Yeah, and who's gonna make me?

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.480
All right. All right.
Don't get your prop in a twist.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:27.400
What a jerk. Sorry, buddy.
Looks like it's the end of the line.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.320
Buddy?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:31.400
(SHIP'S HORN)

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.640
(ENGINE REVS)

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:35.160
TANNOY: Incoming.
All workers report to the loading dock.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.680
Leland Turbo, this is Finn McMissile.
I'm at the rally point. Over.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:40.760
(STATIC)

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.400
All right, fellas, you know the drill.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:46.160
Leland, it's Finn. Please respond. Over.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.560
(STATIC)

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:52.320
Come on, guys. These crates
aren't gonna unload themselves.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.320
(GERMAN ACCENT)
Too many cars here. Out of my way.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.640
Professor Zündapp?

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.640
Here it is, Professor. You wanted to
see this before we load it?

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.680
Ah, yes. Very carefully.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.080
-(SPEAKS GERMAN)
-Oh, a TV camera.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.680
-What does it actually do?
-This camera is extremely dangerous.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.600
What are you up to now, Professor?

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:28.320
This is valuable equipment. Make sure
it is properly secured for the voyage.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.320
-You got it.
-Hey, Professor Z!

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:32.880
GREM: This is one of those
British spies we told you about.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:37.080
Yeah! This one we caught sticking
his bumper where it didn't belong.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.400
ZÜNDAPP: Agent Leland Turbo.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.880
(GASPS)

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.080
It's Finn McMissile!

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.160
He's seen the camera! Kill him!

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.360
TANNOY: All hands on deck!
All hands on deck!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.080
Whoa!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.000
Waargh!

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.960
(BEEPING)

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.000
(ENGINE REVS)

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.560
(SQUEALING)

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.280
What?

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.640
Get to the boats!

